    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean let the pressure go? it's hard to let go of anything when it feels like the only way to actually stop feeling this guilty is to just... stop being here. like, if the balance is so broken, wouldn't it be more right if the person who actually deserved to be here was the one left?",
